  "established": [
    "Complete return,typed-hit-class,recovery,sand-leaper adjustment and HP-percentage routines run unchanged under ASan/UBSan. Existing complete missile/health source is reused without regenerating its accepted stage. Link namespaces only instrument calls around unchanged class/recovery bodies;the inherited seed literal i64-to-ULL platform shim is checked against the original pinned function.",
    "Town/row/source and missing-room ordering,hit-class-before-uninterruptible/null-source/dead-mode guards,cached death before reaction,block species exceptions,Stun bypass of ordinary recovery suppression,and source two-stage RNG/integer thresholds are recorded. Sand-leaper adjustment runs after the initial knockback-mode fallback. Both compile-time Uber branches are retained.",
    "Nondivisible FP maximum-life thresholds use integer division before comparison;the matrix records RNG draws where an aggregated multiply comparison would suppress recovery. This is a separate exact-source consumer requirement;the existing native generic recovery is not changed here.",
    "Typed hit class has a process-wide rotating four-element scan with a counter that advances only when its helper is called;magic is absent from that scan. The complete recovery helper uses the full final hit class,FP total,integer maximum-life thresholds and zero,one or two actual source RNG draws."
  ],
  "services": [
    "NPC targets only;all player-only branches retain guarded services. Source monster base-ID,row/mode/state presence,room/town,stat storage,mode requests,kill,deferred-state application,network refresh and AI notifications are explicit fixture services. No real death/animation/path scheduling is supplied. Source stat/state indices and ancillary layout remain declared;monster mode/base-hit-class IDs and life/hit-class flag follow pinned headers.",
    "Return does not commit HP here;health is supplied as an already-committed field. The full class regression package is unchanged. Native reaction consumers,modern executable comparison,persistence/input/actor integration and final effects/icons remain unfinished."
  ]
